{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54288","headline":"送人罢尉归山 · 郑良士","name":"送人罢尉归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数年山县掌闲司，罢任还同到任时。\n临别更无邀客酒，还归空有寄僧诗。\n路傍岳色行难尽，馆宿泉声梦最迟。\n想达故斋春日晚，旧[栽]（裁）庭树是花枝。\n（同前第六册第四三八三页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}